    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/servlet/mvc/method/annotation/RequestMappingHandlerMapping.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.servlet.mvc.method.annotation\"><code>RequestMappingHandlerMapping</code></a> implementation that will only find a handler method if a\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/Repository.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository\"><code>Repository</code></a> is exported under that URL path segment. Also ensures the\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/orm/jpa/support/OpenEntityManagerInViewInterceptor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.orm.jpa.support\"><code>OpenEntityManagerInViewInterceptor</code></a> is registered in the application context. The OEMIVI is required for the\nREST exporter to function properly.",
      "translation": "实现<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/servlet/mvc/method/annotation/RequestMappingHandlerMapping.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.servlet.mvc.method.annotation\"><code>RequestMappingHandlerMapping</code></a>，该实现仅在<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/Repository.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository\"><code>Repository</code></a>导出到该 URL 路径段时才会查找处理器方法。此外，确保<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/orm/jpa/support/OpenEntityManagerInViewInterceptor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.orm.jpa.support\"><code>OpenEntityManagerInViewInterceptor</code></a>已注册到应用程序上下文中。OEMIVI 对于 REST 导出器正常工作是必需的。",
      "count": 1
    },
